perf review? this is our ingest worker, a long-running node process that stays up for weeks. uploads are newline-delimited JSON, usually a few MB but some customers send 3-4 GB files

```js
const fs = require('node:fs/promises');
const seen = new Map(); // ids we've already saved, so we can skip duplicates

export async function handleUpload(job) {
  const buf = await fs.readFile(job.path);
  const rows = buf.toString('utf8').split('\n');
  for (const row of rows) {
    if (!row) continue;
    const rec = JSON.parse(row);
    if (seen.has(rec.id)) continue;
    seen.set(rec.id, rec);
    await saveRecord(rec);
  }
}
```

